# Example tools/analysis/cea_corpus.path.
#
# Copy this file to tools/analysis/cea_corpus.path (that filename, without
# ".example") and edit the path below to point at src/engine of your own
# checkout of the CEA Xbox 360 decompile tree. That file is gitignored, so
# each machine keeps its own path without touching tracked source.
#
# Lines starting with "#" and blank lines are ignored; the first real line
# is used as the corpus root.
#
# Resolution order used by cea_corpus_index.py, cea_body.py, and
# cea_propagate_names.py:
#   1. --corpus <path> on the command line
#   2. HALO_CEA_CORPUS environment variable
#   3. this file (tools/analysis/cea_corpus.path)
#
# Example value (equivalent to HALO_CEA_CORPUS=/path/to/halocea/src/engine):
/path/to/halocea/src/engine
